Cell["\<\
The exact identities and two-dimensional series checks support the displayed \
monodromy formulas. The invariant pairing and its independent exact \
reconstruction are also available in 04-exact-monodromy-bilinear-checks.nb. \
The notebooks use the same loop ordering, orbit basis, and upper-side \
logarithm convention.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8c03c772-12ec-48d9-95cc-b7dcc6d4c3cb"],

